KaTeX 0.16.40 (https://katex.org, https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX)

Vendored from the npm package `katex` 0.16.40: dist/katex.min.css,
dist/katex.min.js, dist/fonts/*.woff2, and the MIT LICENSE. The .woff and
.ttf font fallbacks are dropped — WebKit on macOS 14+ (our minimum) always
selects the woff2 source from the CSS @font-face lists.
